                <pb facs="0844" n="720" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg720"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.6363 Standard Oil/318½: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Teheran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gotlieb</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-12-20T18:00:00+03:25"><hi rendition="#italic">December 20,
                                1923—6 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received December 20—4:28
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>This afternoon I officially witnessed signing of north Persian oil concession by
                    Reza Khan, Prime Minister, and R. Soper representing Sinclair Exploration
                    Company. I shall send text as soon as possible.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gotlieb</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
